# 🌾 Crop Yield Prediction System

An end-to-end **Machine Learning application** that predicts crop yield using historical agricultural data from India.

This project uses an **XGBoost Regression model** to analyze crop-related factors such as **state, crop type, season, and crop year** to estimate crop yield.

The trained Machine Learning model is deployed through a **Flask REST API** and integrated with a **React.js frontend** to provide an interactive prediction system.

---

## 🚀 Project Highlights

- Built a complete Machine Learning pipeline from data processing to deployment
- Performed data cleaning and feature engineering
- Developed an XGBoost-based regression model for yield prediction
- Created a Flask API for model deployment
- Designed a React-based user interface for real-time predictions

