## 📊 Dataset

**Crop Production in India Dataset**

The dataset contains historical crop production records collected from different states of India.

### Input Features:
- State Name
- Crop Name
- Season
- Crop Year

### Prediction Output:
- Crop Yield

---

## 🔍 Machine Learning Workflow

```
Data Collection
        ↓
Data Cleaning & Preprocessing
        ↓
Exploratory Data Analysis
        ↓
Feature Engineering
        ↓
XGBoost Model Training
        ↓
Model Evaluation
        ↓
Flask API Deployment
        ↓
React Web Application
```

---

## 🤖 Model Used

### XGBoost Regressor

XGBoost was selected because it:
- Handles complex patterns in structured data
- Provides high prediction performance
- Works effectively with agricultural datasets

---

