---

## ▶️ How to Run

### Backend

```bash
cd backend
python app.py
```

Backend runs at:

```
http://127.0.0.1:5000/
```

---

### Frontend

```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

Frontend runs at:

```
http://localhost:5173/
```

